<title>FINLAND: EFORE 95/96 PRE-TAX PROFIT DOWN 77 PCT.</title>
<headline>EFORE 95/96 PRE-TAX PROFIT DOWN 77 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to end-October</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations and taxes     4.3 vs 19.1</p>
<p> Net sales					  183.9 vs 152.1</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	10.3 vs 24.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish electronic components maker is Efore Oy (former Finlandia Interface Oy). The company said in a statement the results were preliminary and that its official accounts would be published in the week beginning February 24.</p>
<p>Efore said its orderbooks were up and that it expected net sales to rise. The group's net sales target for the first six months of its 1996/97 financial year is 120 million markka, Efore said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0245</p>
